  "instructions": "You control the right paddle in a game of Pong. The court is court.w wide and court.h tall; y = 0 is the top edge and y grows downward, so \"up\" DECREASES y and \"down\" INCREASES y. The ball moves by (ball.vx, ball.vy) each step and bounces off the top and bottom edges. Your paddle (paddle.y is its centre) sits at x = paddle.x. When ball.vx > 0 the ball is coming to you: work out the y where it will reach x = paddle.x and move so that paddle.y is within {tol} units of it. When ball.vx < 0 the ball is moving away. Answer with one move only.",
  "criteria": {
   "up": "The ball is coming and will reach your paddle more than {tol} units above paddle.y.",
   "down": "The ball is coming and will reach your paddle more than {tol} units below paddle.y.",
